{"3345550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tactical Annihilation", "steam_appid": 3345550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Annihilation</strong> is a sci-fi turn-based strategy game played on a hexagonal grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features full base-building mechanics, a rich variety of unit types, and innovative sci-fi themed systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat operations are optimized for intense engagements—you can box-select and directly command multiple units at once, and offload non-critical units to an AI-assisted decision system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes over 70 unit and building types, covering complete land, sea, and air forces, defensive structures, and colossal mega units that can turn the tide of battle in a single stroke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 commanders grant special abilities to your troops, along with powerful skills capable of reshaping the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ Streamlined Controls &amp; AI Assistance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box-select multiple units for collective orders, making it easy to command vast armies. In the later stages, use the AI-assisted decision system to handle non-critical units, so you can focus your attention on decisive engagements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/ded91f5082c0d41c097d5284c264b31b.poster.avif?t=1788228354\" width=500 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/ded91f5082c0d41c097d5284c264b31b.webm?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/ded91f5082c0d41c097d5284c264b31b.mp4?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ Base Building &amp; Economic Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike many other strategy games, this title incorporates base construction and economic operations. Build economic structures, factories, defense towers, and even deploy long-range artillery batteries to turn defense into offense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/738435346414a6e1cc06cdcbf79be9a9.poster.avif?t=1788228354\" width=500 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/738435346414a6e1cc06cdcbf79be9a9.webm?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/738435346414a6e1cc06cdcbf79be9a9.mp4?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ Mega Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your economic advantage into an unstoppable force that crushes enemy lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the massive armored tank, the colossal airship, or the gigantic missile-spider!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/68ab0c208647aaf873baa56978efcaf4.poster.avif?t=1788228354\" width=500 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/68ab0c208647aaf873baa56978efcaf4.webm?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/68ab0c208647aaf873baa56978efcaf4.mp4?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ Diverse Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 unit and building types, including a complete roster of naval, ground, and air forces, plus defensive towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, there are spider units that can scale hills and hover units that glide over lava.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/d60a79c1fc95c51cb5dc13030f6ad533.poster.avif?t=1788228354\" width=500 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/d60a79c1fc95c51cb5dc13030f6ad533.webm?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/d60a79c1fc95c51cb5dc13030f6ad533.mp4?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ Choose Your Commander</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from 12 unique commanders to grant passive traits to your forces, and unleash game-changing active skills that can turn the tables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/140507c9d299525673c1e56c043095e5.poster.avif?t=1788228354\" width=500 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/140507c9d299525673c1e56c043095e5.webm?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/140507c9d299525673c1e56c043095e5.mp4?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Campaign mode with 26 missions—learn the units and master the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ BattleSpace mode—extra challenge scenarios across 30 maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Highly customizable Skirmish mode with 20+ maps, supporting up to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Built-in powerful map editor with trigger-based scripting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Annihilation</strong> is a sci-fi turn-based strategy game played on a hexagonal grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features full base-building mechanics, a rich variety of unit types, and innovative sci-fi themed systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat operations are optimized for intense engagements—you can box-select and directly command multiple units at once, and offload non-critical units to an AI-assisted decision system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes over 70 unit and building types, covering complete land, sea, and air forces, defensive structures, and colossal mega units that can turn the tide of battle in a single stroke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 commanders grant special abilities to your troops, along with powerful skills capable of reshaping the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ Streamlined Controls &amp; AI Assistance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box-select multiple units for collective orders, making it easy to command vast armies. In the later stages, use the AI-assisted decision system to handle non-critical units, so you can focus your attention on decisive engagements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/ded91f5082c0d41c097d5284c264b31b.poster.avif?t=1788228354\" width=500 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/ded91f5082c0d41c097d5284c264b31b.webm?t=1788228354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset